---
layout: base.njk
title: 소식
---
<section class="page-hero grid-overlay relative pt-20 pb-16 md:pt-24 md:pb-20">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
    <p class="text-sm font-bold text-techblue-300 tracking-wider mb-3">NEWS</p>
    <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white leading-snug">디씨테크 소식</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-400 max-w-2xl">공지사항, 보도자료, 전시회 참가 소식 등 디씨테크의 새로운 소식을 전해드립니다.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
    {% if collections.news | length %}
    <ul class="divide-y divide-slate-200 border-t border-slate-200">
      {% for post in collections.news %}
      <li>
        <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="flex gap-5 py-6 group">
          {% if post.data.thumbnail %}
          <div class="w-28 h-20 sm:w-36 sm:h-24 rounded-lg overflow-hidden bg-slate-100 shrink-0">
            <img src="{{ post.data.thumbnail }}" alt="{{ post.data.title }}" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
          </div>
          {% endif %}
          <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold text-techblue-500 bg-techblue-50 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1">{{ post.data.category }}</span>
              <time class="text-xs text-slate-400">{{ post.data.date | date }}</time>
            </div>
            <h2 class="font-bold text-navy-900 group-hover:text-techblue-500 transition-colors">{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1.5 line-clamp-2">{{ post.data.summary }}</p>
          </div>
        </a>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    {% else %}
    <div class="text-center py-20">
      <p class="text-slate-400">등록된 소식이 없습니다.</p>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
